            "review_id": "REV_24109463_p1_0",
            "reviewer_id": "User_24109463_1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Du Concept - Coffee Bar",
            "review_text": "hòa\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nA unforgettable experience\nOct 2023 • Solo\nI've been to this place several times, but today, I'm finally writing a review. Speaking of the ambiance, the bar predominantly embraces a dark color scheme, creating a mysterious and alluring atmosphere. Amidst this, golden lights shimmer, evoking a warm and intimate feel. These two seemingly contrasting colors harmonize beautifully, giving the place a unique charm.\n\nIn terms of beverages, besides the classic cocktails, what impressed me the most about Du Bar is their cocktails inspired by renowned niche fragrance collections from around the world. Here, you not only get to savor delicious cocktails but also experience the scents that make up those very cocktails. Furthermore, the staff here is incredibly enthusiastic, providing attentive service, and occasionally, you'll encounter the adorable manager. This place is undoubtedly one of my top choices for special occasions or romantic dates.\nRead more\nWritten October 25, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
