            "review_title": "Review at Du Concept - Coffee Bar",
            "review_text": "Quang Tiến T\n2 contributions\n0\nDU BAR - PERFUME COCKTAIL BAR\nJul 2022 • Solo\nDu Bar – Here you will witness an extremely beautiful Saigon, slowly enjoying jazz music. But the drinks here are reasonably priced, the cost of a cocktail is nearly $15.\n\nNot a spacious bar, Du Bar is cozy and intimate. Make delicious and easy-to-drink cocktails, especially drinks inspired by scents. The manager here is very attentive and understanding, too cute. The music is free, the sound is perfect and the selection of timeless songs is played. Classy, elegant service.\n\nThe second floor at Du Bar also has a Scentury Concept perfume shop with many niche perfume lines to delight those who are passionate about scents.\nRead more\nWritten August 30, 2022",
